{{Term/Store|Eldin Ostrich|Eldin Ostriches|Series, BotW, TotK|plural}} are [[Creature]]s in {{TLoZ Series}}.<ref>{{Cite|'''Eldin Ostrich'''|Hyrule Compendium|BotW}}</ref><ref>{{Cite|'''Eldin Ostrich'''|Hyrule Compendium|TotK}}</ref>

==Characteristics==
==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Compendium/Extract|Eldin Ostrich}}
Eldin Ostriches are [[Ostrich]]es that can be found in the [[Eldin (Region)|Eldin]] [[Region]] of the [[Hyrule Kingdom]], particularly the [[Scorching Climate]] surrounding [[Death Mountain]].<ref name="Compendium">{{Cite|This large bird makes its home in the volcanic region of Eldin. Their heat-resistant feathers and skin are evolutionary traits produced by the harsh environment. Their wings are too small to facilitate flight, but their long legs make them pretty speedy runners. |Hyrule Compendium|BotW}}</ref> They have heat resistant feathers that allow them to live comfortably in the Region.<ref name="Compendium"/> Although they are unable to fly, Eldin Ostriches can run fast.<ref name="Compendium"/> When killed, they drop either a [[Raw Bird Thigh]] or a [[Raw Whole Bird]].

